# Google AI Studio writes transient files into this directory while
# the preview is running (logs, scratch JSON, agent metadata, etc.).
# They typically start with a leading dot, so we ignore them but
# keep the folder itself under version control as a placeholder.
#
# This folder is intentionally separate from `public/assets/` (which
# holds the real bundled app icons, screenshots, and sounds).
# `aistudio/` is just a workspace scratch directory managed by
# AI Studio's preview runtime.
.*
!.gitignore
!.gitkeep
